Now we need to verify loading profile nominal: verify_loading_profile_nominal SCB SK driver_operator_alpha LB TL (requires candidate_staged_for_loading SCB, candidate_skill_certificate_linked SCB SK, candidate_operator_linked SCB driver_operator_alpha, candidate_loading_container_linked SCB LB, loading_container_leg_linked LB TL, not destination_leg_loaded TL, not candidate_loading_verified SCB). We have candidate_staged_for_loading true, we will have skill cert linked, operator linked, loading container linked, loading container leg linked, destination_leg_loaded false (since we haven't set it), candidate_loading_verified false. So we can verify.

