- Then execute_*_dispatch (origin_dispatch for OA, destination_dispatch for DA, schedule_dispatch for SCB) which requires dispatch_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked, not dispatched. Effect sets dispatched, vehicle_available, dispatch_slot_available.

